flowchart TD
    A[Embedded Trusted Root] --> B[Sequential Root Update]
    B --> C[Verify Timestamp]
    C --> D[Verify Snapshot]
    D --> E[Verify Targets / Delegations]
    E --> F[Authenticate Release Envelope]
    F --> G[Check releaseSequence / securityEpoch]
    G --> H[Download Exact Artifacts]
    H --> I[Verify SHA-256 / Size]
    I --> J{Executable?}
    J -- yes --> K[WinVerifyTrust / Authenticode\n+ allowed SplitOS publisher]
    J -- no --> L[Typed Schema / Artifact Policy]
    K --> M[Compatibility / Applicability]
    L --> M
    M --> N{Normal Update or Recovery?}
    N -- Normal --> O[Monotonic Update Policy]
    N -- Recovery --> P[Verify exact RecoveryAuthorization]
    O --> Q[Stage / Apply Candidate]
    P --> Q
